; XOPS-WXR d3d8 probe - export table
;
; Only export Direct3DCreate8, which is the one function the game imports.
; The game looks up DebugSetMute via GetProcAddress; DXVK 1.10.1's d3d8.dll
; does not export it, so the game handles NULL when the mod is absent. Do the
; same here: exporting a wrapper changed the call/return stack shape and moved
; the crash from address 0 to address 1.
LIBRARY d3d8
EXPORTS
    Direct3DCreate8                             @1
